{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-56880","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66518","text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-56881","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66519","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-66520","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-66521","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-66522","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-66523","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-66524","text":" Full Implementation (OTP Supervision Tree + MCP)"}]},{"id":"blk-56882","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66525","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-56883","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66526","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-56884","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66527","text":"You are building the "},{"id":"spn-66528","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol"},{"id":"spn-66529","text":" — the enforcement runtime that sits above agents and below humans. The harness orchestrates [&] pipelines, enforces governance contracts, gates execution on epistemic confidence, and ensures no agent skips retrieval, fabricates provenance, or acts beyond its coverage."}]},{"id":"blk-56885","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66530","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/OS-008-HARNESS.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-66531","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-56886","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66532","text":"OS-008 is the "},{"id":"spn-66533","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement layer"},{"id":"spn-66534","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-56887","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-56888","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66535","text":"The harness wraps agents like an OTP supervisor wraps processes — it doesn't do the work, it ensures the work is done correctly."}]},{"id":"blk-56889","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66536","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-56890","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66537","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-56891","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:      Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nOTP Patterns:  DynamicSupervisor, GenServer, GenStateMachine\nMCP:           JSON-RPC over HTTP (harness_start_session, harness_sprint_status,\n               harness_approve_action, harness_escalation_response)\nIntegration:   Graphonomous MCP (memory), Delegatic (policy), OS-006 (permissions)\nAuth:          Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — workspace-scoped sessions)\nTesting:       ExUnit + property-based testing for state machine transitions\nDeploy:        Part of OpenSentience runtime (not standalone)"},{"id":"blk-56892","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66538","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-56893","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66539","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-56894","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66540","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-66541","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org/lib/"},{"id":"spn-66542","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-56895","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"opensentience.org/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── open_sentience/\n│   │   ├── harness/\n│   │   │   ├── supervisor.ex           # DynamicSupervisor for harness sessions\n│   │   │   ├── session.ex              # Session GenServer — supervises one orchestrated task\n│   │   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer.ex    # Prerequisite constraint model (section 5)\n│   │   │   ├── quality_gate.ex         # Evaluator orchestrator (section 6)\n│   │   │   ├── contract_validator.ex   # [&] governance block enforcement (section 7)\n│   │   │   ├── sprint_controller.ex    # GenStateMachine — planner→generator→evaluator loop (section 9)\n│   │   │   ├── context_manager.ex      # Context window management + compaction (section 8)\n│   │   │   ├── coverage.ex             # Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3)\n│   │   │   ├── audit_entry.ex          # Extended audit entry with provenance (section 10)\n│   │   │   ├── tier_adapter.ex         # Model tier adaptation (section 11)\n│   │   │   └── telemetry.ex            # :telemetry events for harness operations\n│   │   ├── harness.ex                  # Public API — start_session, sprint_status, etc.\n│   │   └── harness_mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex               # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 13)\n│   │       └── tools.ex                # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   └── open_sentience.ex              # Add harness supervisor to application tree\n├── test/\n│   ├── harness/\n│   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer_test.exs\n│   │   ├── quality_gate_test.exs\n│   │   ├── contract_validator_test.exs\n│   │   ├── sprint_controller_test.exs\n│   │   ├── context_manager_test.exs\n│   │   ├── coverage_test.exs\n│   │   └── session_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_governance.json   # [&] governance block\n│       ├── sprint_contract.json               # Sample sprint contract\n│       └── coverage_scenarios.json            # Coverage→dispatch test cases\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-56896","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66543","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-56897","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66544","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-56898","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66545","text":"Phase 1: Pipeline Enforcer (weeks 1-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-56899","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66546","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-66547","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineEnforcer"},{"id":"spn-66548","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-66549","marks":["code"],"text":"harness/pipeline_enforcer.ex"},{"id":"spn-66550","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-56900","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56902","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66551","text":"GenServer tracking stage state machine: "},{"id":"spn-66552","marks":["code"],"text":":idle → :retrieving → :analyzing → :deliberating → :acting → :storing"}]}],"id":"blk-56901","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56904","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66553","text":"Prerequisite rules from section 5.1:"}]}],"id":"blk-56903","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56906","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66554","marks":["code"],"text":"{:any, :write}"},{"id":"spn-66555","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-66556","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :retrieve_context}"}]}],"id":"blk-56905","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56908","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66557","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :deliberate}"},{"id":"spn-66558","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-66559","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :topology_analyze}"}]}],"id":"blk-56907","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56910","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66560","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :execute_action}"},{"id":"spn-66561","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-66562","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :coverage_query}"}]}],"id":"blk-56909","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56912","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66563","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :learn_from_outcome}"},{"id":"spn-66564","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-66565","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :execute_action}"}]}],"id":"blk-56911","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56914","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66566","marks":["code"],"text":"{:session, :complete}"},{"id":"spn-66567","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-66568","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :store_node}"}]}],"id":"blk-56913","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56916","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66569","marks":["code"],"text":"{:sprint, :advance}"},{"id":"spn-66570","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-66571","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :quality_gate, result: :pass}"}]}],"id":"blk-56915","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56918","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66572","marks":["code"],"text":"check_prerequisite/3"},{"id":"spn-66573","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-66574","marks":["code"],"text":"{:allow, state}"},{"id":"spn-66575","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-66576","marks":["code"],"text":"{:block, reason, state}"}]}],"id":"blk-56917","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56920","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66577","text":"Tracks violations as audit entries"}]}],"id":"blk-56919","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56922","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66578","text":"Wraps MCP tool dispatch — called before every tool invocation"}]}],"id":"blk-56921","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-56923","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66579","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-66580","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement the two enforced pipelines"},{"id":"spn-66581","text":" (section 3)"}]},{"id":"blk-56924","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56926","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66582","text":"Reactive pipeline: "},{"id":"spn-66583","marks":["code"],"text":"query |> recall |> topology |> deliberate(if κ>0) |> store"}]}],"id":"blk-56925","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56928","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66584","text":"Proactive pipeline: "},{"id":"spn-66585","marks":["code"],"text":"heartbeat |> survey |> triage |> dispatch |> store"}]}],"id":"blk-56927","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56930","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66586","text":"Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3) — 10 routing rules"}]}],"id":"blk-56929","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-56931","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66587","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-66588","marks":["bold"],"text":"Integration with OS-006"},{"id":"spn-66589","text":" (section 5.3)"}]},{"id":"blk-56932","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56934","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66590","text":"OS-008 PipelineEnforcer runs BEFORE OS-006 PermissionEngine"}